import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Why We Recommend | Buy Better Finds" description="Learn how Buy Better Finds evaluates products and creates recommendations.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">Our methodology</div>
    <h1>Why we recommend the products we do.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We aim to make product discovery simpler by focusing on usefulness, value, tradeoffs, and fit—not just popularity.</p>

    <h2>What we look for</h2>
    <p>We consider practical features, intended use, product category, value, common tradeoffs, and the type of shopper a product is best suited for.</p>

    <h2>Original analysis</h2>
    <p>Our product pages are designed to add original commentary and analysis. We do not simply copy retailer descriptions or customer reviews. We summarize the important buying considerations in our own words so shoppers can compare products more easily.</p>

    <h2>Recommendations are not one-size-fits-all</h2>
    <p>A product can be excellent for one shopper and wrong for another. Our goal is to explain the differences so you can make the final decision.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
    <p>Some product links may be affiliate links. If you purchase through a qualifying affiliate link, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate compensation does not guarantee that a product will be recommended, ranked, or described positively.</p>

    <h2>Amazon Associates</h2>
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>

    <h2>Product information changes</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, specifications, promotions, shipping, and return policies can change. Always verify current information at the retailer or manufacturer's website before purchasing.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
